      "claim": "L6 hepatic clearance records for the closest benzimidazole and morpholine analogs are predominantly low to moderate: KBP-7018 HLM CLint 0.09 mL/min/mg (C249), SUVN-G3031 HLM CLint 0.59 µL/min/mg (C247), KR-69232 HLM CLint 5.78 µL/min/mg (C230), compound 14c predicted hepatic clearance below 30% LBF (C267), and compound 8 below 30% LBF (C253).",
